# "Recent" on the light "Gesso" theme.
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente-gesso.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/recenti-gesso.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --theme rada-light --demo recenti ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/recenti-gesso.png"
Sleep 1s
